{"id":"jamaica-plain","name":"Jamaica Plain","qid":"Q985993","country":"United States","locality":"Boston","lat":"42.3075","lon":"-71.113055555","built":"","year":null,"year_text":"","century":"","era":"Date not recorded","period":"","date_basis":"","style":"","heritage":"","type":"gay village; neighborhood in Boston","wikipedia":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jamaica_Plain","text":"Jamaica Plain is a neighborhood of 4.4 square miles (11 km2) in Boston, Massachusetts, United States. Settled by Puritans seeking farmland to the south, it was originally part of Roxbury. The community seceded from Roxbury during the formation of West Roxbury in 1851 and became part of Boston when West Roxbury was annexed in 1874.","text_source":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jamaica_Plain","text_license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","real":[],"depictions":[{"id":"fallout-4--jamaica-plain","game":"fallout-4","name":"Jamaica Plain","verified":false,"text":"Jamaica Plain is a location south of Boston and a possible settlement in the Commonwealth in 2287.","text_source":"https://fallout.fandom.com/wiki/Jamaica_Plain","text_license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","images":[{"id":"gh-5881081ece62","w":1400,"h":788,"credit":{"text":"Screenshot from Fallout 4, © Bethesda Softworks.","source":"https://fallout.fandom.com/wiki/File:Bottlecap_mine_Jamaica_Plain.jpg","via":"Fandom (fallout)","note":"Fandom upload by Jspoelstra on 2023-11-20"}},{"id":"gh-778ba42a4b94","w":1024,"h":512,"credit":{"text":"Screenshot from Fallout 4, © Bethesda Softworks.","source":"https://fallout.fandom.com/wiki/File:BillboardsLrgJamaicaPlain_d.png","via":"Fandom (fallout)","note":"Fandom upload by Kdarrow on 2022-03-04"}},{"id":"gh-fb1d8d6e360a","w":1400,"h":788,"credit":{"text":"Screenshot from Fallout 4, © Bethesda Softworks.","source":"https://fallout.fandom.com/wiki/File:Bottlecap_mine_JP_workshop.jpg","via":"Fandom (fallout)","note":"Fandom upload by Jspoelstra on 2023-11-22"}}]}]}